WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.040
RYAN: Today we're talking about
clean energy, manufacturer

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.100
spotlight, and innovation
through inclusion.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.530
I'm Ryan, and welcome
to This Week in Cloud,

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.350
where we serve you the
lowest latency news.

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.200
Having achieved 100%
annual renewable energy

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.050
matching every year
since 2017, we're

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.470
now focused on achieving
our moonshot goal of 24/7

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:25.490
carbon-free energy by 2030
by purchasing clean energy

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.670
generated from an increasingly
diverse set of technologies

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:31.400
to decarbonize grids
across the globe.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.070
We are pleased to share
that clean energy projects

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:35.780
that we signed over
the past few years

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:39.650
across Belgium, Denmark
Chile, and Finland are now

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.010
operational, providing
important clean-energy resources

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:46.160
to the grids where we operate,
and taking us one step closer

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.710
to 24/7 carbon-free energy.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.990
Head to the blog to learn more.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:55.590
Join us on May 5 to hear leading
manufacturers and technology

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:58.350
partners discuss how they
transformed operations

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.260
and empowered their teams to
solve productivity challenges

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.720
and build competitive and
sustainable businesses

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.123
with Google Cloud.

00:01:05.123 --> 00:01:06.540
You will hear from
thought leaders

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.690
how a data platform, data
analytics, and AI models

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:12.000
can create a solid
foundation for scaling

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.030
smart-factory initiatives and
enable unique optimization

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:16.670
models.

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:19.760
Jim Hogan is both the
principal innovation strategist

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:23.390
at Google Cloud and the VP of
accessibility and technology

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:25.580
for Google's
Disability Alliance.

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:28.370
Being autistic, he's
faced severe challenges

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:30.860
in finding belonging
in the workplace.

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:32.780
This experience
fires his passion

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:35.090
for workplace equity
on many fronts.

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:37.070
It also informs
his technical work

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:40.010
of aligning corporate
aspirations to the realities

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.780
of software architecture.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.360
The common thread, he says,
is delivering outcomes

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:46.550
to customers based
on the understanding

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:49.767
that belonging is the
fuel of innovation.

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:51.850
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:54.530
or see a full list,
check out the link.

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:55.870
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:57.770
Leave us a comment or tweet us.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:00.300
We'll see you in the Cloud.

